    "not_counted": [
      "initialize.request",
      "notifications/initialized",
      "tools.call.request"
    ],
    "fixture_rule": "Independent serialized literal notification padded with ASCII data to exactly1024 or1025 UTF8bytes excluding LF. It contains no dynamic RPC ID. Assert exact fixture byte size before launch. RPC response bytes come from peer independent emission audit, all response data literal except declared id coordinate."
